Comment:
 All the icons are created by Fabio Viola and released under the terms of
 CC BY-NC-SA v.3 (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/)
 .
 Icons 'Connect' and 'Disconnect' are fairly based on 'plug' icon created
 by cablout (http://openclipart.org/user-detail/caboulot) (Public Domain)
 .
 Icons 'Wire' and 'Netemu' ('Wirefilter' in Virtualbricks 2.1 and older)
 are fairly based on 'tango network wired' icon created by warszawianka
 (http://openclipart.org/user-detail/warszawianka) (Public+Domain)
 .
 Icon 'Event' is fairly based on 'tango appointment new' icon created by
 warszawianka (http://openclipart.org/user-detail/warszawianka) (Public
 Domain)

